{"version":1,"title":"DESIGN-LAB V2 云端项目全量架构审计、产品重规划与重构迁移任务包","backing_conversation_id":"6a81c193-4dd4-83ea-b866-2f52ba7a6482","widget_session_id":"e4d5d19a-f35d-4f52-9cc8-0418362c029d","widget_state":{"status":"completed","is_static_preview":true,"report_message":{"id":"2f019b15-b018-4dc1-95eb-61cf6ebe282a","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1786888662.088007,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":["# DESIGN-LAB V2 云端项目全量架构审计、产品重规划与重构迁移任务包\n\n## 执行摘要与审计基线\n\n### 审计对象与证据强度\n\n本次审计针对云端私有仓库 **`DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB`**。通过已连接的 GitHub 仓库直接读取，确认该仓库真实存在，默认分支为 `main`，仓库描述为 **“AI-native open visual design laboratory / AI 原生开放视觉设计实验室”**；仓库创建于 **2026-03-18**，本次可见元数据中最近一次 push 为 **2026-04-13**。同时确认 `DTALEX66/OPEN-DESIGN-Assistance` 已归档，并明确迁移至 DESIGN-LAB；同一账号下还存在私有仓库 `WORK-LAB` 与 `ArcheAxis`。\n\n本轮直接读取到的 DESIGN-LAB 根目录包括：\n\n```text\n.adobe/\n.github/\n.vscode/\n\nadapters/\nbrand/\nbriefs/\ncli/\ncore/\ndesign-lab/\ndomains/\nexperiments/\nintelligence/\nknowledge/\nproduction/\nquality/\nresearch/\nschemas/\nscripts/\nskills/\ntasks/\ntests/\ntools/\n\nAGENTS.md\nCLI_OVERVIEW.md\nMODEL_ROLES.md\nPORTING.md\nREADME.md\nRunning_Checklist.md\nCONTRIBUTING.md\nSECURITY.md\nCODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\npackage.json\n...\n```\n\n递归仓库树还确认存在 `.github/workflows/ci.yml`、Adobe workspace 配置、adapter template、MCP adapter、orchestration adapter、CLI、核心 registry、domain、quality、production、knowledge、research、schemas、skills、tasks 和 tests 等内容。\n\n**证据等级需要区分：**\n\n|结论类型|证据强度|说明|\n|---|---:|---|\n|仓库身份、私有状态、创建时间、默认分支|高|GitHub 仓库直接读取|\n|根目录与模块是否存在|高|GitHub contents/tree 直接读取|\n|OPEN-DESIGN-Assistance 已归档|高|GitHub 仓库直接读取|\n|某模块的内部业务逻辑是否完整|中/低|本轮取得完整目录树，但未逐行读取全部源码|\n|测试覆盖率、运行时性能、真实 Adobe 执行成功率|未指定|没有得到实际 CI run、coverage、benchmark 运行数据|\n|WORK-LAB / ArcheAxis 的完整内部契约|未指定|确认仓库存在，但本轮没有逐文件完成两个仓库源码审计|\n|线上部署方式、生产用户、调用量、成本|未指定|仓库元数据不足以判断|\n\n因此，本报告是一次**仓库结构级 + 产品架构级 + 迁移工程级审计**，而不是声称已经完成逐行安全审计或运行时压测。\n\n### 核心判断\n\nDESIGN-LAB **不需要再次从零设计**。现有仓库已经明显超过“OPEN-DESIGN-Assistance 时代的一个设计助手”，因为它已经具备：\n\n`core → intelligence → domains → adapters → quality → production → knowledge → research → schemas → skills → tasks → tests`\n\n这样一条相当完整的能力链，并且已经出现 Adobe workspace、MCP、adapter template、orchestration、CLI、CI 等工程基础。\n\n真正的问题是：\n\n> **仓库已经具备“平台的模块”，但产品架构还需要从“模块集合”进一步收敛成一套有明确内核、协议、状态模型和质量门禁的设计操作系统。**\n\n换句话说，下一阶段不应该继续横向增加更多目录，而应该解决五个最关键的问题：\n\n1. **建立唯一 Design Intelligence Kernel**，明确谁拥有设计状态、推理、批评、选择和迭代权。\n2. **把 knowledge 升级为可计算的 Design Memory**，而不是只保存静态知识。\n3. **把 quality 从检查模块升级为 Quality Engine + Quality Gate**，让质量决定是否允许进入生产。\n4. **把 adapters 从“连接器集合”升级成统一 Capability Contract**，实现 Adobe、MCP、本地工具和未来工具的一致调用。\n5. **把 production 变成真正的生产闭环**：设计状态 → 工具执行 → artifact → preflight → deliverable → evidence。\n\n### 推荐的 V2 产品定义\n\n建议正式冻结为：\n\n> **DESIGN-LAB 是 AI 原生的专业视觉设计能力与生产基础设施。它将设计意图、设计知识、设计推理、领域规则、工具执行、质量评价和生产交付统一为可编排、可验证、可积累的能力系统。**\n\n它**不是**：\n\n- 某个 LLM 的 UI；\n- Photoshop/Illustrator 自动化脚本仓库；\n- Figma 替代品；\n- 单一生成式图像产品；\n- 通用 Agent runtime；\n- 通用知识库；\n- WORK-LAB 的重复实现。\n\n建议未来产品价值公式定义成：\n\n\\[\n\\text{DESIGN-LAB Value}\n=\n\\text{Design Intelligence}\n\\times\n\\text{Professional Knowledge}\n\\times\n\\text{Tool Executability}\n\\times\n\\text{Quality Assurance}\n\\times\n\\text{Memory Compounding}\n\\]\n\n其中任意一项接近零，系统都会重新退化为“会生成图的聊天机器人”。\n\n### 总体成熟度判断\n\n以下是基于**架构存在性和产品闭环完整性**的架构评估，不代表实际运行 benchmark：\n\n|能力|当前估值|V2目标|主要问题|\n|---|---:|---:|---|\n|产品定位|82/100|95|已经明确，但系统契约仍需冻结|\n|模块覆盖|88/100|95|模块很全，职责可能重叠|\n|核心内核|65/100|95|core/intelligence/design-lab 三者需收敛|\n|领域建模|72/100|90|需要彻底坚持领域优先，而非软件优先|\n|工具适配|78/100|95|已有 adapter/MCP/Adobe 基础，缺统一 capability contract|\n|知识资产|62/100|95|需要从 knowledge 升级为 memory|\n|质量控制|64/100|95|需要从“评价”升级为强制门禁|\n|生产闭环|65/100|95|artifact/preflight/delivery 状态需要统一|\n|模型中立性|75/100|95|需要 Provider SPI 与 policy 分离|\n|测试与可维护性|70/100|90|已经存在 tests/CI，但真实 coverage 未指定|\n|整体|**约 72/100**|**≥92/100**|不是缺功能，而是缺统一协议和闭环|\n\n**结论：不建议大爆炸式 rewrite。建议实施“保持能力、替换骨架”的渐进式 V2 migration。**\n\n## 产品边界、职责划分与目标架构\n\n### DESIGN-LAB、WORK-LAB、ArcheAxis 应形成三层体系\n\n三个仓库不应该彼此调用内部实现，更不应该复制能力。\n\n建议冻结为：\n\n|系统|系统角色|拥有的数据/状态|应该负责|明确不负责|\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|**WORK-LAB**|Control Plane / 工作控制面|任务、Agent、资源、预算、模型策略、运行策略|任务编排、Agent 生命周期、provider policy、权限、成本、全局工作流|具体设计知识、设计质量算法、PSD/SVG 等领域执行细节|\n|**DESIGN-LAB**|Design Capability Plane / 设计能力面|DesignProject、DesignState、Critique、Artifact、QualityReport、DesignMemory|设计推理、领域能力、设计工具调用、评价、生产、设计记忆|全局 Agent 调度、通用知识治理|\n|**ArcheAxis**|Evidence & Knowledge Plane / 证据知识面|source、evidence、citation、knowledge provenance|研究资料、证据、出处、知识组织、研究链|Photoshop 操作、设计评分、生产交付|\n\n正确的跨系统调用应该是：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    U[用户 / Hermes] --> W[WORK-LAB<br/>Control Plane]\n\n    W -->|DesignTask<br/>budget / policy / provider constraints| D[DESIGN-LAB<br/>Design Capability Plane]\n\n    D -->|ResearchQuery| A[ArcheAxis<br/>Evidence & Knowledge Plane]\n    A -->|EvidenceBundle<br/>sources / confidence / provenance| D\n\n    D --> K[Design Intelligence Kernel]\n    K --> M[Design Memory]\n    K --> Q[Quality Engine]\n    K --> AD[Adapter Runtime]\n\n    AD --> P[Photoshop / Illustrator / Figma / Blender / MCP / CLI]\n    P --> AR[Artifacts]\n\n    AR --> Q\n    Q -->|pass| PROD[Production Pipeline]\n    Q -->|fail + critique| K\n\n    PROD --> DEL[Deliverables + Manifest + QA Evidence]\n    DEL --> W\n```\n\n### 最重要的边界原则\n\n**WORK-LAB 选择“用哪个模型、花多少钱、谁执行”；DESIGN-LAB 决定“设计上应该做什么以及是否合格”。**\n\n例如：\n\n```yaml\n# WORK-LAB 下发\ntask:\n  type: design.brand.poster\n  provider_policy: balanced\n  token_budget: 45000\n  timeout_s: 900\n\n# DESIGN-LAB 内部决定\ndesign_policy:\n  domain: commercial.poster\n  quality_profile: commercial_print\n  required_scores:\n    visual_quality: 80\n    commercial_effectiveness: 75\n    production_readiness: 95\n```\n\n这可以避免 DESIGN-LAB 内部出现：\n\n```text\nif model == \"DeepSeek\":\nif model == \"Claude\":\nif agent == \"Hermes\":\n```\n\n等长期架构债务。\n\n### DESIGN-LAB V2 建议总体布局\n\n建议不再让 `core/`、`intelligence/`、`design-lab/` 三个目录形成潜在的三个“中心”。\n\nV2 推荐：\n\n```text\nDESIGN-LAB/\n├── apps/\n│   ├── cli/\n│   └── api/\n│\n├── design_lab/\n│   ├── kernel/\n│   │   ├── project/\n│   │   ├── state/\n│   │   ├── perception/\n│   │   ├── reasoning/\n│   │   ├── critique/\n│   │   ├── decision/\n│   │   ├── iteration/\n│   │   └── registry/\n│   │\n│   ├── domains/\n│   ├── memory/\n│   ├── quality/\n│   ├── production/\n│   ├── adapters/\n│   ├── providers/\n│   ├── research/\n│   └── contracts/\n│\n├── schemas/\n├── assets/\n│   ├── brand/\n│   ├── templates/\n│   └── briefs/\n│\n├── skills/\n├── experiments/\n├── tests/\n│   ├── unit/\n│   ├── contract/\n│   ├── integration/\n│   ├── golden/\n│   └── e2e/\n│\n├── tasks/\n├── scripts/\n└── docs/\n```\n\n这里的关键不是换目录名，而是形成：\n\n```text\nContracts\n    ↓\nKernel\n    ↓\nDomain\n    ↓\nPlan\n    ↓\nAdapter\n    ↓\nArtifact\n    ↓\nQuality Gate\n    ↓\nProduction\n    ↓\nMemory\n```\n\n这一条**单向、可测试的主链**。\n\n## 现有模块逐项审计与模块对照\n\n### 模块对照表：当前 → 建议\n\n|当前模块|当前角色判断|主要问题/风险|V2建议|动作|\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|`core/`|基础 runtime、registry、project 等核心对象|容易与 `intelligence/`、`design-lab/` 重复拥有核心权力|`design_lab/kernel/`|**重构**|\n|`intelligence/`|智能/推理相关能力|名称过宽，容易成为所有 AI 逻辑垃圾桶|拆为 `kernel/{perception,reasoning,critique,decision,iteration}`|**拆分并迁移**|\n|`design-lab/`|疑似另一层主实现/命名空间|与仓库本身同名，若和 core 并存可能造成入口不唯一|统一为正式 Python/package namespace `design_lab/`|**重命名/收敛**|\n|`domains/`|领域能力|方向正确，但必须禁止按应用软件成为一级领域|`design_lab/domains/`|**保留并规范**|\n|`adapters/`|外部工具、MCP、Adobe、orchestration|已有良好基础；风险是每个 adapter 自创接口|`design_lab/adapters/` + Capability Contract|**重点升级**|\n|`quality/`|质量评价|如果只是评分函数，则无法形成生产约束|`design_lab/quality/` + gate + profile + evaluator|**升级**|\n|`production/`|生产相关能力|需要显式 Artifact、Preflight、Delivery Manifest|`design_lab/production/`|**升级**|\n|`knowledge/`|静态知识/规则|静态知识与项目经验没有区分|拆 `memory/` 与外部 ArcheAxis research evidence|**重构**|\n|`research/`|设计研究|可能和 ArcheAxis 的通用研究能力重复|只保留 design-specific research orchestration|**收窄**|\n|`schemas/`|数据 schema|这是 V2 极重要资产|升级成统一 contract/schema source of truth|**保留强化**|\n|`brand/`|品牌资产/设计语言|资产和 runtime 代码混在仓库根部|`assets/brand/`，领域逻辑放 domains|**迁移**|\n|`briefs/`|brief 模板|合理，但属于资产/contract|`assets/briefs/` 或 `schemas/brief/`|**迁移**|\n|`cli/`|CLI 入口|合理|`apps/cli/`|**迁移**|\n|`tools/`|工具能力|容易与 adapters 重叠|执行型工具并入 adapters；开发工具放 scripts|**拆分**|\n|`skills/`|Agent/能力技能|应该保留为可编排的上层技能|保持独立但只能调用 public API|**保留规范**|\n|`experiments/`|实验|正确，需要与生产代码隔离|保持|**保留**|\n|`tasks/`|任务定义|适合 Harness/Agent 执行|进一步 schema 化|**强化**|\n|`tests/`|测试|已有，这是重要优势|拆 unit/contract/integration/golden/e2e|**强化**|\n|`.adobe/`|Adobe workspace/task 配置|属于特定工具开发环境|保留，但不得成为业务核心依赖|**保留**|\n|`.github/`|CI/模板/CODEOWNERS|成熟工程基础|增加 architecture/schema/contract gates|**强化**|\n\n### 对 `core` 的判断\n\n现有树已经出现类似：\n\n```text\ncore/design_project.py\ncore/domain_registry.py\ncore/capability_registry.py\ncore/path_utils.py\ncore/run.py\n```\n\n这说明项目并非没有内核，而是**已经有内核雏形**。\n\n因此推荐的动作不是“新建第二套 design-intelligence kernel”，而是：\n\n> **把现有 core 升级成唯一 Kernel，把 intelligence 的决策能力并入 Kernel。**\n\n推荐核心对象最少固定为：\n\n```text\nDesignProject\nDesignBrief\nDesignIntent\nDesignState\nDesignPlan\nDesignVariant\nCritique\nDecision\nArtifact\nQualityReport\nDeliveryManifest\nMemoryRecord\n```\n\nKernel 只能依赖 abstractions/contracts，不能直接依赖 Photoshop、GPT、DeepSeek 等具体 provider。\n\n### 对 `intelligence` 的判断\n\n`intelligence` 这个名字在早期很好用，但产品规模扩大后非常危险，因为：\n\n```text\nAI 相关 = intelligence\n```\n\n最终几乎任何东西都能进入该目录。\n\n建议改成明确的设计认知流水线：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    B[Brief] --> P[Perception]\n    P --> I[Intent Modeling]\n    I --> R[Reasoning]\n    R --> C[Concept Generation]\n    C --> V[Variants]\n    V --> CR[Critique]\n    CR --> D[Decision]\n    D --> E[Execution Plan]\n    E --> Q[Quality Evaluation]\n    Q -->|Fail| R\n    Q -->|Pass| PR[Production]\n```\n\n其中 `critique` 和 `decision` 必须是一等公民。**“能生成”不是专业设计系统；“能拒绝一个差方案并说明为什么”才开始接近专业设计系统。**\n\n### 对 `domains` 的重新划分\n\n应按**职业设计问题**而不是按 Photoshop/Figma 等工具划分。\n\n推荐：\n\n```text\ndomains/\n├── brand/\n│   ├── identity/\n│   ├── visual_system/\n│   └── campaign/\n│\n├── graphic/\n│   ├── poster/\n│   ├── social/\n│   └── advertising/\n│\n├── ecommerce/\n│   ├── hero_image/\n│   ├── product_detail/\n│   └── campaign/\n│\n├── editorial/\n│   ├── publication/\n│   ├── report/\n│   └── presentation/\n│\n├── packaging/\n│\n├── product_ui/\n│   ├── web/\n│   ├── mobile/\n│   └── design_system/\n│\n├── spatial/\n│   ├── exhibition/\n│   ├── retail/\n│   └── signage/\n│\n├── motion/\n│\n├── video/\n│\n├── three_d/\n│\n└── game_visual/\n```\n\n每个 domain 应拥有同一种契约：\n\n```text\ndomain.yaml\nbrief.schema.json\nrules/\nheuristics/\nquality_profile.yaml\nproduction_profile.yaml\nskills/\nexamples/\ntests/\n```\n\n例如：\n\n```yaml\nid: ecommerce.hero_image\nversion: 2.0\n\ninputs:\n  - product_assets\n  - brand_context\n  - campaign_goal\n  - channel\n\nquality_profile: ecommerce_hero_v2\nproduction_profile: ecommerce_web\n\ncapabilities:\n  required:\n    - image.composite\n    - typography.layout\n    - image.mask\n    - export.raster\n```\n\n这实现：\n\n> **领域要求 capability，adapter 提供 capability。**\n\n因此“电商设计”不会绑定 Photoshop；只要某个执行环境能够满足 capability contract，就可以替换。\n\n## V2 核心能力：Kernel、Memory、Quality、Production、Adapters 与 Providers\n\n### Design Intelligence Kernel\n\n建议 Kernel 划分为六个相对稳定的能力域：\n\n```text\nkernel/\n├── project/\n├── perception/\n├── reasoning/\n├── critique/\n├── decision/\n├── iteration/\n└── registry/\n```\n\n设计过程不应该保存成一串聊天消息，而应保存成**显式 Design State**：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"DL-2026-001\",\n  \"revision\": 12,\n  \"domain\": \"ecommerce.hero_image\",\n  \"intent\": {\n    \"business_goal\": \"increase_click_through\",\n    \"audience\": [\"young_professionals\"],\n    \"message_priority\": [\n      \"product\",\n      \"benefit\",\n      \"call_to_action\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"constraints\": {\n    \"canvas\": {\n      \"width\": 1920,\n      \"height\": 1080\n    },\n    \"brand\": \"brand://example/v4\"\n  },\n  \"variants\": [],\n  \"selected_variant\": null,\n  \"quality_status\": \"pending\"\n}\n```\n\n每一次修改产生：\n\n```text\nState N\n  ↓ command / decision\nState N+1\n  ↓ quality evaluation\nEvaluation\n  ↓\nAccept / Reject / Iterate\n```\n\n这样才能实现：\n\n- reproducibility；\n- undo/replay；\n- 多 Agent 协作；\n- benchmark；\n- 审计；\n- 设计经验提取。\n\n### Design Memory：知识不是文件夹，而是经验资产\n\n建议把现有 `knowledge/` 分成：\n\n```text\nmemory/\n├── semantic/\n├── episodic/\n├── procedural/\n├── visual/\n└── indexes/\n```\n\n对应：\n\n|Memory 类型|内容|例子|\n|---|---|---|\n|Semantic|设计通识|“小字号正文的对比度/可读性原则”|\n|Procedural|如何做|“电商透明瓶体抠图与光影合成流程”|\n|Episodic|项目经验|“某次海报因 CTA 层级弱导致迭代”|\n|Visual|视觉模式|优秀构图、品牌语言、布局 embedding|\n|Failure Memory|失败模式|过度 AI 化、假文字、透视错误、错误 logo|\n\n建议统一 schema：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"design-memory-record.v1\",\n  \"id\": \"mem_01...\",\n  \"type\": \"failure_pattern\",\n  \"domain\": \"ecommerce.product_visual\",\n  \"title\": \"产品图过度生成化\",\n  \"context\": {\n    \"task\": \"premium beverage hero image\",\n    \"medium\": \"web\"\n  },\n  \"observation\": \"包装边缘与标签细节被生成模型重新解释\",\n  \"cause\": [\n    \"source product was used as semantic reference rather than locked asset\",\n    \"insufficient identity-preservation constraint\"\n  ],\n  \"rule\": {\n    \"statement\": \"真实商品主体默认禁止生成模型重绘关键品牌区域\",\n    \"severity\": \"must\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"project\",\n      \"ref\": \"project://...\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"confidence\": 0.91,\n  \"created_by\": \"quality-engine\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-16T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"status\": \"validated\"\n}\n```\n\n这样过去的“醇净项目 AI 味过重”之类经验，不再只是聊天历史，而可以进入下一次任务的检索与约束。\n\nMemory 写入不能无门槛。建议：\n\n```text\n项目经验\n → candidate memory\n → deduplication\n → evidence/confidence\n → human or rule validation\n → active memory\n```\n\n否则系统长期运行后会把模型幻觉也沉淀成“知识”。\n\n### Quality Engine：从打分器升级为质量门禁\n\n建议整体评分使用**分层评价而非单一视觉模型分数**：\n\n\\[\nQ =\nw_vV +\nw_bB +\nw_cC +\nw_tT +\nw_pP +\nw_fF\n\\]\n\n其中：\n\n- \\(V\\)：视觉质量 Visual；\n- \\(B\\)：Business / Communication 商业沟通；\n- \\(C\\)：Constraint Compliance 约束符合；\n- \\(T\\)：Technical Correctness 技术正确性；\n- \\(P\\)：Production Readiness 生产就绪；\n- \\(F\\)：Fidelity / Brand Fidelity 品牌与真实资产忠实度。\n\n建议默认商业视觉 profile：\n\n|维度|建议权重|示例量化指标|\n|---|---:|---|\n|视觉构成|15%|balance、hierarchy、alignment、spacing|\n|字体与可读性|10%|字号、行距、拥挤、文本溢出、字体规则|\n|色彩|10%|对比度、品牌色偏差、色域|\n|内容与信息层级|15%|核心信息识别、CTA 显著性、阅读路径|\n|品牌一致性|15%|logo safe area、色彩、字体、视觉语言|\n|真实度/资产忠实度|10%|产品轮廓、标签、logo、结构差异|\n|商业目标|10%|目标元素显著性、信息优先级匹配|\n|生产正确性|15%|尺寸、DPI、bleed、format、missing fonts 等|\n\n不是所有维度都应该平均。\n\n例如包装印刷：\n\n```text\n漂亮 = 94\n尺寸正确 = 100\n品牌 = 90\n出血 = fail\n```\n\n最终结果必须：\n\n```text\nFAIL\n```\n\n而不是 `(94+100+90+0)/4 = 71` 后勉强通过。\n\n因此必须增加 **hard gates**：\n\n```yaml\nquality_gate:\n  minimum_total: 82\n\n  minimum_dimensions:\n    production_readiness: 95\n    brand_fidelity: 85\n\n  blocking_rules:\n    - missing_asset\n    - invalid_logo\n    - text_overflow\n    - insufficient_bleed\n    - wrong_color_mode\n```\n\n最终数据结构：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"score\": 86.4,\n  \"decision\": \"fail\",\n  \"blocking_issues\": [\n    {\n      \"code\": \"PRINT_BLEED_MISSING\",\n      \"severity\": \"blocker\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"dimensions\": {\n    \"composition\": 91,\n    \"typography\": 87,\n    \"brand_fidelity\": 92,\n    \"production_readiness\": 68\n  }\n}\n```\n\n建议不要依赖单一多模态 LLM 自己“看起来评分”。质量层应使用：\n\n```text\nDeterministic Rules\n        +\nDocument / Layer Inspection\n        +\nComputer Vision Metrics\n        +\nMultimodal Judge\n        +\nDomain Rubric\n        +\nOptional Human Approval\n```\n\n并对 judge 做 calibration：\n\n- 与资深设计师评分相关性；\n- false-pass rate；\n- false-reject rate；\n- 同样输入的评分方差；\n- 不同 provider 的一致性；\n- blocker detection recall。\n\n**最关键 KPI 不是“模型平均打多少分”，而是：**\n\n> **Quality Gate 放行的成品中，有多少后来被人工判定存在严重错误。**\n\n即：\n\n\\[\nFalsePassRate =\n\\frac{\\text{错误放行数量}}\n{\\text{总放行数量}}\n\\]\n\n生产类 profile 建议目标 `FalsePassRate < 2%`，关键品牌/印刷场景进一步压低。\n\n可视化建议采用两个独立柱状图：\n\n1. `Current vs V2 capability maturity`；\n2. 各 Domain 的 `Quality Gate pass rate / human rejection rate`。\n\n不要仅使用饼图；这类比较数据柱状图可读性更高。\n\n### Production Pipeline：结束点不是“生成图片”\n\n建议生产状态机：\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> Draft\n    Draft --> Review\n    Review --> Revision: quality fail\n    Revision --> Review\n    Review --> Approved: design gate pass\n    Approved --> Rendering\n    Rendering --> Preflight\n    Preflight --> Revision: blocker\n    Preflight --> Packaged: pass\n    Packaged --> Delivered\n    Delivered --> Archived\n    Archived --> [*]\n```\n\n每种 production profile 显式定义规则。\n\n#### 印刷\n\n检查至少包括：\n\n```text\nphysical dimensions\nbleed\nsafe area\nresolution / effective PPI\ncolor mode / output intent\nembedded/outlined fonts\nmissing links\noverprint where applicable\ntransparency handling\nPDF profile\npage count/order\n```\n\n#### Web / 电商\n\n```text\npixel dimensions\naspect ratio\nfile size\nalpha\ncolor profile\nformat\nresponsive variants\nsafe text region\nplatform-specific constraints\n```\n\n#### UI\n\n```text\ncomponent mapping\ntoken usage\ncontrast\nresponsive states\nmissing states\nasset export\nnaming\ndev handoff metadata\n```\n\n#### 视频/动态\n\n```text\nduration\nframe rate\nresolution\naudio presence/loudness profile\ncodec/container\nsafe area\ncaption/subtitle requirement\nthumbnail/poster\n```\n\n最终交付不应只返回文件，而是：\n\n```text\ndeliverable/\n├── output.*\n├── preview.*\n├── source.*\n├── manifest.json\n├── quality-report.json\n└── provenance.json\n```\n\n### Adapter Contract：V2 最值得优先标准化的接口\n\n现有仓库已经存在：\n\n```text\nadapters/_template\nadapters/adobe\nadapters/mcp\nadapters/orchestration/adapter.py\nadapters/orchestration/plugins.py\n```\n\n这是一个很好的基础。\n\n下一步不要继续直接增加 adapter，而是先冻结：\n\n```python\nclass DesignAdapter:\n    def manifest(self) -> AdapterManifest: ...\n    def capabilities(self) -> list[Capability]: ...\n    def validate(self, command: DesignCommand) -> ValidationResult: ...\n    def execute(self, command: DesignCommand) -> ExecutionResult: ...\n    def inspect(self, artifact: ArtifactRef) -> ArtifactState: ...\n    def health(self) -> HealthStatus: ...\n```\n\n工具不暴露“软件名字作为业务能力”，而是声明：\n\n```yaml\nadapter:\n  id: adobe.photoshop\n  version: 2.0\n\ncapabilities:\n  - id: image.layer.create\n  - id: image.layer.mask\n  - id: image.selection.subject\n  - id: image.adjustment.curves\n  - id: image.text.create\n  - id: image.export.raster\n```\n\n领域只请求：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"capability\": \"image.layer.mask\",\n  \"args\": {\n    \"target\": \"layer://product\",\n    \"mode\": \"non_destructive\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n由 runtime 决定由哪个 adapter 执行。\n\n#### Adobe 能力地图建议\n\n|工具|V2 一级 Capability|重点 Schema / Commands|测试重点|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|Photoshop|raster/compositing|document、layer、mask、selection、text、adjustment、export|像素尺寸、层结构、非破坏性、导出|\n|Illustrator|vector/layout|artboard、path、shape、text、symbol、swatch、export|路径、字体、品牌色、SVG/PDF|\n|InDesign|editorial/layout|document、page、frame、style、link、preflight、PDF|文本溢出、链接、页码、印前|\n|After Effects|motion|composition、layer、property、keyframe、render|时间线、帧率、duration、render|\n|Premiere|video editing|sequence、clip、track、caption、export|媒体链接、时基、音视频输出|\n|Acrobat/PDF|document/preflight|page、metadata、PDF inspection/preflight|PDF 交付与合规|\n|Lightroom|photo processing|catalog/asset、develop preset、export|非破坏性处理、一致性|\n|Firefly/生成服务|generative media|generate、edit、variation、reference|身份保持、provenance、prompt trace|\n\n并非所有应用当前是否拥有同等程度的自动化 API 能力已经在本轮逐项验证，**具体可执行 API 与版本兼容矩阵：未指定，应在 adapter implementation task 中以 Adobe 当前官方 API 为准进行 capability probing。**\n\n#### Command Schema 示例\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"design-command.v1\",\n  \"id\": \"cmd_0192\",\n  \"capability\": \"image.text.create\",\n  \"target_adapter\": null,\n  \"document\": \"artifact://working/master\",\n  \"args\": {\n    \"content\": \"新品上市\",\n    \"position\": {\n      \"x\": 120,\n      \"y\": 160\n    },\n    \"style\": {\n      \"font_family\": \"Source Han Sans SC\",\n      \"font_weight\": 700,\n      \"size_pt\": 46\n    }\n  },\n  \"constraints\": {\n    \"editable\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\nResult：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"execution-result.v1\",\n  \"command_id\": \"cmd_0192\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"adapter\": \"adobe.photoshop\",\n  \"adapter_version\": \"2.x\",\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"layer_created\",\n      \"ref\": \"layer://headline\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"artifact_revision\": 19\n}\n```\n\n测试必须至少四层：\n\n```text\nschema test\n   ↓\nadapter contract test\n   ↓\napplication integration test\n   ↓\ngolden artifact test\n```\n\nGolden test 不仅比较截图，还应比较**可编辑结构**：\n\n```text\nExpected:\n3 text layers\n1 smart object\n2 masks\nno rasterized headline\ncanvas = 1920×1080\n```\n\n### Provider Layer 与模型中立性\n\n建议：\n\n```text\nproviders/\n├── base.py\n├── registry.py\n├── text/\n├── vision/\n├── image/\n├── embedding/\n└── local/\n```\n\n但 provider **不等于工具 adapter**：\n\n```text\nProvider = 推理/生成能力\nAdapter  = 外部设计执行能力\n```\n\nProvider contract：\n\n```python\nclass Provider:\n    capabilities: set[str]\n\n    def invoke(\n        self,\n        request: ModelRequest,\n        *,\n        policy: ModelPolicy\n    ) -> ModelResponse:\n        ...\n```\n\nDESIGN-LAB 内部只允许依赖 capability，例如：\n\n```text\nreasoning.long_context\nvision.design_critique\nembedding.multimodal\nimage.generate\nimage.edit\n```\n\n而不是：\n\n```text\ndeepseek_v3()\ngpt_x()\nminimax_x()\n```\n\n### 本地模型接入\n\n本地模型不应由 DESIGN-LAB 自己维护模型生命周期。\n\n建议：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    K[DESIGN-LAB Kernel] --> PR[Provider Contract]\n    PR --> WP[WORK-LAB Provider Policy]\n\n    WP --> API[Cloud API]\n    WP --> LOC[Local Gateway]\n\n    LOC --> LLM[Local LLM]\n    LOC --> VLM[Local VLM]\n    LOC --> EMB[Embedding]\n    LOC --> IMG[Image Model]\n```\n\n如果本地模型库继续位于：\n\n```text\nD:\\All projects\\Model library\n```\n\nDESIGN-LAB 只应该收到类似：\n\n```yaml\nprovider_endpoint:\n  id: local.vlm.default\n  capability:\n    - vision.design_critique\n  endpoint: ...\n  model_ref: ...\n```\n\n而不把绝对 Windows 路径写进业务代码。\n\n模型角色建议：\n\n|角色|优先能力|是否适合本地|\n|---|---|---:|\n|设计规划|reasoning / long context|是|\n|视觉 critique|VLM|是|\n|embedding / retrieval|multimodal embedding|非常适合|\n|快速分类/规则抽取|small LLM|非常适合|\n|高质量最终视觉生成|image model|视 GPU 而定|\n|高风险最终 QA|VLM + deterministic checks|可混合|\n\n这样既保持 privacy/local-first，又不会让产品架构绑死某一个模型。\n\n## 对标产品、参考项目与战略位置\n\n### 竞品的正确理解方式\n\nDESIGN-LAB 的真正竞争对象不是“另一个 AI 绘图网站”。\n\n它横跨五类产品：\n\n```text\nAI Design Suite\nProfessional Creative Tools\nUI/Product Design Platforms\nGenerative Media Workflows\nAgentic Design Systems\n```\n\n因此必须分维度比较。\n\n受本轮审计工具窗口限制，以下对外部项目主要用于**架构定位参考**；其截至 2026-08-16 的具体最新 SKU、价格、当前模型版本和 API 覆盖度没有逐项重新核验的项目均标记为“未指定”，不应把本表当作采购清单。\n\n### 对标竞品比较表\n\n|产品/项目|核心强项|结构化可编辑设计|跨专业领域|Agent/自动化|生产级工具链|知识/长期记忆|DESIGN-LAB 应学习|不应复制|\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|---|\n|Adobe Creative Cloud / Firefly|专业生产工具深度、行业文件格式|★★★★★|★★★★★|较强且持续发展|★★★★★|项目级，长期设计经验层未指定|专业生产、非破坏性编辑、preflight|把产品绑定 Adobe|\n|Figma|UI/协作/结构化设计系统|★★★★★|★★|较强|★★★★ UI|团队资产强|component/token/structured state|把视觉设计收窄成 UI|\n|Canva|低门槛模板化设计、一站式内容生产|★★★|★★★★|较强|★★★|品牌资产强|模板、品牌约束、速度|只追求“一键生成”|\n|Penpot|开放、设计系统、Web 标准取向|★★★★★ UI|★★|中|★★★|中|开放格式和结构化设计|复制完整编辑器|\n|ComfyUI|生成模型 workflow/graph、可复现|低|视觉生成强|★★★★★|★★|workflow history|DAG、node capability、可复现|让 node graph 成为产品本体|\n|Blender|3D 专业生产和 Python 自动化|★★★★★ 3D|3D 专项|★★★★|★★★★★ 3D|中|可脚本化专业工具 adapter|自己重造 DCC|\n|0xdesign Design Lab 类项目|设计方案探索与 agent workflow|依实现而定|较窄|★★★★|未指定|未指定|variant → critique → refinement|降级成单一 coding-agent skill|\n|OPEN-DESIGN 类开源探索|开放设计 Agent / tool workflow|依项目而定|依实现而定|较强|未指定|未指定|开放协议、Agent integration|把“开放”误解为无限插件集合|\n\n### DESIGN-LAB 的差异化机会\n\n不建议在以下方向与成熟产品正面竞争：\n\n```text\n“比 Photoshop 更会修图”\n“比 Figma 更完整地画 UI”\n“比 Canva 模板更多”\n“比生成模型更会出图”\n```\n\n这些都不是最强战略位置。\n\n真正有机会建立壁垒的是：\n\n> **跨工具的专业设计 intelligence + 可执行 production + 质量证明 + 经验复利。**\n\n即：\n\n```text\nCanva / Firefly:\nprompt → output\n\nFigma:\nstructured document → collaboration\n\nComfyUI:\nworkflow → generated media\n\nDESIGN-LAB:\nbrief\n → evidence\n → intent\n → design reasoning\n → structured variants\n → critique\n → professional tool execution\n → quality gate\n → production preflight\n → deliverable\n → reusable memory\n```\n\n这也是 DESIGN-LAB 与现有工具最大的产品布局区别。\n\n建议产品能力最终形成四层：\n\n```text\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Design Products                         │\n│ Brand / Ecommerce / UI / Packaging...  │\n├────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Design Intelligence                     │\n│ Reason / Critique / Decide / Memory    │\n├────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Execution & Quality                     │\n│ Adapter / Artifact / QA / Production   │\n├────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Infrastructure                          │\n│ WORK-LAB / ArcheAxis / Providers       │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## 重构、迁移与优先级路线\n\n### 迁移原则\n\n从 `OPEN-DESIGN-Assistance` 到 DESIGN-LAB V2 不应采取：\n\n```text\ncopy old repo\n→ 改名\n→ 清理一点代码\n→ 继续开发\n```\n\n因为目前已经进入 DESIGN-LAB 阶段，且旧仓库已经归档。\n\n建议从现在开始把迁移定义为：\n\n> **OPEN-DESIGN-Assistance = historical source；当前 DESIGN-LAB = migration source；DESIGN-LAB V2 = target architecture。**\n\n也就是说，**不要再次从旧仓库覆盖当前仓库。**\n\n### 删除、修改与新增策略\n\n#### 建议删除或淘汰\n\n这里的“删除”原则上指经过引用扫描后的删除，而不是立刻 `rm -rf`。\n\n```text\n旧 OPEN-DESIGN-Assistance 专有命名\n旧 Agent/provider 硬编码\n重复 core/intelligence 入口\n重复 tool/adapter wrapper\n无消费者的 legacy schema\n已由 contracts 替代的 DTO\n临时迁移 shim\n过期实验代码进入 production path 的部分\n```\n\n所有删除项在执行前必须：\n\n```text\ngit grep / static dependency scan\n→ test\n→ deprecation\n→ remove\n```\n\n无法从本轮树结构判断的具体 legacy 文件名：**未指定**。\n\n#### 建议修改\n\n```text\ncore/              → design_lab/kernel/\nintelligence/      → 拆入 kernel/*\ndomains/           → design_lab/domains/\nadapters/          → design_lab/adapters/\nquality/           → design_lab/quality/\nproduction/        → design_lab/production/\nknowledge/         → design_lab/memory/\nresearch/          → design_lab/research/\ncli/               → apps/cli/\nbrand/             → assets/brand/\nbriefs/            → assets/briefs/ 或 schemas/\ntools/             → adapters/ 或 scripts/\n```\n\n#### 建议新增\n\n```text\ndesign_lab/contracts/\ndesign_lab/kernel/state/\ndesign_lab/kernel/critique/\ndesign_lab/kernel/decision/\ndesign_lab/memory/\ndesign_lab/providers/\ndesign_lab/quality/gates/\ndesign_lab/quality/profiles/\ndesign_lab/production/preflight/\ndesign_lab/production/delivery/\ntests/contract/\ntests/golden/\ntests/e2e/\ndocs/architecture/\ndocs/adr/\n```\n\n### 迁移步骤表\n\n|阶段|动作|关键输出|验收条件|主要风险|\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|Baseline Freeze|给当前 main 建 V1 baseline/tag，记录 tree/CI/schema|V1 manifest|能够从 tag 完整恢复|低|\n|Inventory|扫描模块、imports、schema、CLI、adapter、tests|dependency inventory|所有生产模块有 owner/status|低|\n|Contract First|先定义 DesignProject/State/Command/Artifact/Quality 等 schema|V2 contracts|schema validation + compatibility tests|中|\n|Kernel Extraction|将 core/intelligence 核心逻辑迁入 kernel|唯一 kernel API|旧入口通过 shim 工作|高|\n|Domain Normalization|按职业设计领域建立统一 domain package|domain manifest|每 domain 符合相同 contract|中|\n|Adapter V2|建立 capability manifest/command/result/health contract|adapter SDK v2|至少 2 个 adapter 通过同一 contract suite|高|\n|Provider Separation|去除模型名硬编码|provider SPI|业务模块无具体 provider import|中|\n|Memory Migration|knowledge → semantic/procedural/episodic memory|memory store/schema|可写、检索、失效、溯源|高|\n|Quality Gate|统一 rule/model/domain evaluator|quality report/gate|可阻止 blocker artifact 进入 production|高|\n|Production V2|引入 artifact/preflight/delivery manifest|交付闭环|E2E 生成可验证 deliverable|高|\n|Compatibility|旧 CLI/task/skill 暂通过 compatibility layer|迁移桥|关键 V1 workflow 继续运行|中|\n|Legacy Removal|移除 shim 与旧目录|纯 V2 tree|repository grep 无 legacy runtime dependency|中|\n|Release|冻结 V2 API/schema|V2 release|CI、E2E、migration docs 全绿|低|\n\n### P0 到 P3 优先级任务表\n\n估时采用**工程人日**，假设 1 名熟悉现有仓库的高级工程师主导，并有 Harness/AI 辅助；由于真实测试覆盖率和源码复杂度未完全取得，估时应视为 ±40% 的规划区间。\n\n|优先级|Task|任务拆解|验收标准|估时|风险|\n|---|---|---|---|---:|---|\n|**P0**|架构基线冻结|inventory、dependency map、ADR、legacy map|所有模块分类为 keep/move/refactor/remove|2–4 人日|低|\n|**P0**|V2 Contracts|State、Command、Artifact、Quality、Memory、Delivery schema|100% schema tests；版本字段与 migration rule 完整|4–7|高|\n|**P0**|Kernel 收敛|core + intelligence 重组；唯一 public API|不存在两个独立 DesignProject 状态源|7–12|高|\n|**P0**|Adapter Contract V2|capability、execute、inspect、health、error taxonomy|至少 Photoshop/Mock adapter 通过统一 contract tests|6–10|高|\n|**P0**|Quality Gate|rubric、hard rules、report、blocking|已知 blocker 样本 100% 阻止进入 production|6–10|高|\n|**P0**|Production Artifact Model|artifact revision、preflight、manifest|E2E 可追踪 source→output→QA|5–8|高|\n|**P1**|Design Memory|memory schema、ingestion、retrieval、validation|至少四类 memory 可 CRUD/retrieve/provenance|6–10|高|\n|**P1**|Domain Standard|domain manifest + quality/production profile|Brand/Ecommerce/UI 三领域迁移通过|5–9|中|\n|**P1**|Provider SPI|text/vision/image/embedding capability abstraction|替换 provider 不修改 domain/kernel|4–7|中|\n|**P1**|Adobe MVP V2|Photoshop + Illustrator capability map|真实或受控 integration test 通过|8–15|高|\n|**P1**|Golden Test Framework|结构与视觉 golden artifacts|CI 自动判断 regression|5–8|中|\n|**P2**|Editorial/Packaging|领域包 + preflight profile|典型 brief→deliverable E2E|6–10/域|中|\n|**P2**|Spatial/Motion/Video/3D|domain + adapter capability mapping|各域至少一个 reference workflow|8–15/域|高|\n|**P2**|Quality Calibration|专家样本、judge calibration|报告相关性、FPR/FNR|8–12|高|\n|**P2**|Memory Learning Loop|项目总结→candidate→validation→reuse|重复项目能命中过往有效经验|5–9|中|\n|**P3**|更多本地模型|VLM/image/embedding local provider|通过 provider conformance tests|3–6/模型|中|\n|**P3**|高级自动路由|按质量/价格/延迟选择 provider/adapter|routing benchmark 优于固定策略|6–10|中|\n|**P3**|跨项目 Design Intelligence|pattern mining / trend / cross-domain transfer|有可审计增益指标|10–20|高|\n|**P3**|高级自动生产|批量、多渠道、变体生产|批量产物全部经过相同 QA gate|8–15|高|\n\n### P0 的“完成定义”\n\nP0 不应该以“新目录创建完”作为完成标准。\n\n真正的 P0 Done 应是：\n\n```text\nBrief\n  ↓\nDesignProject / State\n  ↓\nKernel\n  ↓\nDomain\n  ↓\nDesignCommand\n  ↓\nAdapter\n  ↓\nArtifact\n  ↓\nQualityReport\n  ↓\nQualityGate\n  ↓\nProduction\n  ↓\nDeliveryManifest\n```\n\n至少有一条 reference workflow 在 CI 中端到端运行。\n\n推荐 reference：\n\n```text\ncommercial poster / ecommerce hero\n```\n\n原因是同时能覆盖：\n\n- layout；\n- image；\n- typography；\n- brand；\n- tool execution；\n- visual QA；\n- technical export。\n\n### 主要工程风险\n\n最危险的不是代码量，而是以下四种 migration failure：\n\n**双状态源。** V1 `core` 和 V2 `kernel` 同时维护 project state，会出现无法解释的漂移。迁移期必须只允许一个 authoritative state。\n\n**Schema churn。** 如果开发过程中不断改 DesignState/Artifact schema，所有 adapter、quality、memory 都会跟着重做。所以 Contract First 是 P0。\n\n**Adapter 伪统一。** 如果统一接口最后变成：\n\n```python\nexecute(command: dict)\n```\n\n但每个 adapter 的 `dict` 完全不同，那么只是形式统一。必须统一 capability semantics、错误码、artifact reference 和 transaction/result。\n\n**AI judge 自我循环。** 如果同一个模型既生成又评价，Quality Engine 很可能把自身偏差当成质量。关键 gate 必须混合 deterministic + independent evaluator + benchmark/human calibration。\n\n## Hermes / DeepSeek Harness 可直接执行的 V2 Task Pack\n\n### 推荐任务包格式\n\n每个任务建议使用：\n\n```yaml\ntask_id: DL-V2-P0-001\ntitle: Freeze V2 architecture baseline\npriority: P0\n\nobjective: >\n  ...\n\npreconditions:\n  - ...\n\nscope:\n  include:\n    - ...\n  exclude:\n    - ...\n\ninputs:\n  - ...\n\nactions:\n  - ...\n\noutputs:\n  - ...\n\nacceptance:\n  - ...\n\ntests:\n  - ...\n\ndependencies: []\n\nrisk:\n  level: low\n  mitigations:\n    - ...\n\nrollback:\n  - ...\n\nevidence_required:\n  - changed_files\n  - test_results\n  - migration_notes\n```\n\nHarness **不能以“代码写完了”作为成功信号**。必须提交 evidence。\n\n### 执行顺序\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    T001[DL-V2-P0-001<br/>Baseline & Inventory]\n    T002[DL-V2-P0-002<br/>Contracts]\n    T003[DL-V2-P0-003<br/>Kernel]\n    T004[DL-V2-P0-004<br/>Adapter Contract]\n    T005[DL-V2-P0-005<br/>Artifact & Production Model]\n    T006[DL-V2-P0-006<br/>Quality Engine]\n    T007[DL-V2-P0-007<br/>Reference E2E]\n    T101[DL-V2-P1-001<br/>Design Memory]\n    T102[DL-V2-P1-002<br/>Domain Packages]\n    T103[DL-V2-P1-003<br/>Provider SPI]\n    T104[DL-V2-P1-004<br/>Adobe MVP]\n    T105[DL-V2-P1-005<br/>Golden Tests]\n\n    T001 --> T002\n    T002 --> T003\n    T002 --> T004\n    T002 --> T005\n    T003 --> T006\n    T005 --> T006\n    T004 --> T007\n    T003 --> T007\n    T006 --> T007\n\n    T007 --> T101\n    T007 --> T102\n    T007 --> T103\n    T004 --> T104\n    T007 --> T105\n```\n\n### 可直接下发的 P0 任务\n\n|Task ID|执行内容|前置条件|最终验收|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|`DL-V2-P0-001`|仓库 inventory、依赖图、legacy map、ADR-001|当前 main 可读取|每个根模块有 owner、public API、keep/move/remove 判定；无未分类生产代码|\n|`DL-V2-P0-002`|定义 V2 contracts/schema|001|DesignProject、State、Command、Result、Artifact、Quality、Memory、Delivery 均有版本化 schema 和 tests|\n|`DL-V2-P0-003`|core/intelligence → Kernel|002|只有一个 authoritative DesignState；旧调用通过 shim；unit tests 全绿|\n|`DL-V2-P0-004`|Adapter SDK/Contract V2|002|Mock + 至少一个真实 adapter 通过相同 conformance suite|\n|`DL-V2-P0-005`|Artifact/Production Model|002|artifact revision、source、derived-from、delivery manifest 可追踪|\n|`DL-V2-P0-006`|Quality Engine/Gate|003,005|blocker 可阻止 production；report 可机器读取|\n|`DL-V2-P0-007`|Reference E2E|003–006|一个 brief 从 intake 到 deliverable 全链 CI 通过|\n|`DL-V2-P0-008`|V1 Compatibility|003–007|选定旧 CLI/task workflow 在兼容层下通过|\n|`DL-V2-P0-009`|P0 Architecture Gate|007,008|无关键 circular dependency；schema/API docs 与代码一致|\n\n### 示例：最关键任务 `DL-V2-P0-002`\n\n```yaml\ntask_id: DL-V2-P0-002\ntitle: Establish DESIGN-LAB V2 canonical contracts\npriority: P0\n\nobjective: >\n  建立 DESIGN-LAB 所有核心模块之间唯一、版本化、\n  与 Provider/Adapter 无关的数据契约。\n\npreconditions:\n  - DL-V2-P0-001 completed\n  - existing schema inventory available\n\nscope:\n  include:\n    - DesignBrief\n    - DesignProject\n    - DesignIntent\n    - DesignState\n    - DesignCommand\n    - ExecutionResult\n    - Artifact\n    - Critique\n    - QualityReport\n    - DeliveryManifest\n    - MemoryRecord\n  exclude:\n    - vendor-specific Adobe command implementation\n    - concrete LLM provider SDK\n\nactions:\n  - inventory existing schemas and DTOs\n  - designate canonical schema for each entity\n  - add schema_version\n  - define IDs and reference semantics\n  - define compatibility/migration rules\n  - generate or validate typed models\n  - add positive and negative fixtures\n  - document public contracts\n\nacceptance:\n  - exactly one canonical schema exists for every listed entity\n  - every schema has schema_version\n  - every reference has defined identity semantics\n  - malformed fixtures fail validation\n  - valid fixtures pass validation\n  - no canonical contract imports provider-specific classes\n  - no canonical contract imports Adobe-specific classes\n  - CI runs contract tests\n\nrisk:\n  level: high\n  mitigations:\n    - freeze schemas before adapter migration\n    - require ADR for breaking schema changes\n\nrollback:\n  - retain V1 models behind compatibility namespace\n  - no destructive deletion in this task\n\nevidence_required:\n  - schema inventory\n  - changed-file list\n  - test output\n  - compatibility table\n  - ADR\n```\n\n### 示例：Adapter V2 任务\n\n```yaml\ntask_id: DL-V2-P0-004\ntitle: Implement capability-based Adapter Contract V2\npriority: P0\n\npreconditions:\n  - DL-V2-P0-002\n\nactions:\n  - define AdapterManifest\n  - define Capability\n  - define DesignCommand\n  - define ExecutionResult\n  - define ArtifactInspection\n  - define error taxonomy\n  - implement MockAdapter\n  - migrate one existing adapter\n  - create contract test suite\n\nacceptance:\n  - same DesignCommand can be validated by runtime before execution\n  - unsupported capability returns a standardized error\n  - adapter failures do not leak vendor exceptions to Kernel\n  - command execution emits provenance\n  - contract tests run against MockAdapter and migrated adapter\n```\n\n### 示例：Quality Gate 任务\n\n```yaml\ntask_id: DL-V2-P0-006\ntitle: Build Quality Engine and blocking Quality Gate\npriority: P0\n\npreconditions:\n  - DL-V2-P0-003\n  - DL-V2-P0-005\n\noutputs:\n  - quality profile schema\n  - evaluator registry\n  - deterministic evaluator\n  - model evaluator interface\n  - gate policy\n  - QualityReport\n  - failure fixtures\n\nacceptance:\n  - total score and hard blockers are independent\n  - blocker cannot be overridden by weighted average\n  - every score contains evaluator/provenance/version\n  - identical deterministic fixtures produce identical result\n  - known bad artifacts are rejected\n  - result can directly drive revision or production transition\n```\n\n### Harness 的强制执行规则\n\n建议在 `AGENTS.md` / Harness instruction 中加入：\n\n```text\nRULE 1\nNever create a second canonical model when one already exists.\n\nRULE 2\nNo provider-specific type is allowed in kernel/domain contracts.\n\nRULE 3\nNo adapter-specific type is allowed above adapter boundary.\n\nRULE 4\nNo migration task may delete legacy code before compatibility tests exist.\n\nRULE 5\nEvery architectural task must provide tests and migration evidence.\n\nRULE 6\nQuality FAIL must never silently degrade to PASS.\n\nRULE 7\nProduction artifacts must preserve provenance.\n\nRULE 8\n\"Tests passed\" requires command output, not model assertion.\n\nRULE 9\nUnknown repository behavior must be reported as 未指定, not inferred.\n\nRULE 10\nEvery V2 breaking architectural decision requires an ADR.\n```\n\n建议 Harness 每个任务输出固定机器可读结果：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"DL-V2-P0-004\",\n  \"status\": \"passed\",\n  \"files_added\": [],\n  \"files_modified\": [],\n  \"files_removed\": [],\n  \"tests\": {\n    \"passed\": 0,\n    \"failed\": 0\n  },\n  \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion\": \"...\",\n      \"status\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"...\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"risks_remaining\": [],\n  \"follow_up_tasks\": []\n}\n```\n\n### 最终产品布局结论\n\nDESIGN-LAB 当前最有价值的事实不是“已经有多少设计能力”，而是它已经形成了一组可继续升级的平台骨架：\n\n```text\ncore\nintelligence\ndomains\nadapters\nquality\nproduction\nknowledge\nresearch\nschemas\nskills\ntasks\ntests\nCI\nAdobe/MCP integration\n```\n\n这意味着最错误的下一步是继续无序增加：\n\n```text\n更多模型\n更多 Agent\n更多 Adobe 脚本\n更多 skills\n更多 domain 文件夹\n```\n\nV2 应反过来先冻结六个基础契约：\n\n```text\nDesign State\nCapability\nArtifact\nQuality\nMemory\nProduction\n```\n\n然后所有领域和工具挂在这六个契约之上。\n\n最终推荐的产品公式是：\n\n```text\nDESIGN-LAB V2\n\n= Design Intelligence Kernel\n+ Domain Knowledge\n+ Design Memory\n+ Capability-based Adapters\n+ Provider-neutral Intelligence\n+ Quality Engine\n+ Production Pipeline\n```\n\n而三个云端项目的长期体系应固定成：\n\n```text\nWORK-LAB\n“谁做、何时做、用什么资源做”\n          │\n          ▼\nDESIGN-LAB\n“这个设计应该怎样做、怎样判断、怎样生产”\n          │\n          ▼\nArcheAxis\n“我们的事实、证据和知识依据是什么”\n```\n\n从架构师角度，**当前 DESIGN-LAB 不建议重写；建议进入一次严格的 Contract-First V2 重构。**\n\n最合理的里程碑不是“DESIGN-LAB V2 目录调整完成”，而是：\n\n> **Hermes 提交一个专业设计 brief 后，DESIGN-LAB 能形成显式设计状态，调用任意满足 capability contract 的执行工具，产生可编辑 artifact，经过可解释的 Quality Gate 和生产 Preflight，最终交付带 manifest、质量证据和 provenance 的成品，并把有效经验沉淀回 Design Memory；整个过程中既不依赖某个特定模型，也不依赖某个特定 Adobe 应用。**\n\n达到这一点，DESIGN-LAB 才真正从 **OPEN-DESIGN-Assistance 的“AI 设计助手”** 完成到 **“AI 原生专业设计基础设施”** 的产品跃迁。\n\n### 审计限制与未指定项\n\n目前仍属于“未指定”，不应由执行团队自行猜测的项目包括：当前真实测试覆盖率；CI 最近一次运行结果；各 Adobe adapter 的实际端到端成功率；`core/` 与 `intelligence/` 每个类的真实调用关系；`knowledge/` 当前存储 backend；线上数据库/向量库；真实部署拓扑；WORK-LAB 的 provider contract；ArcheAxis 的 evidence schema；生产用户与 SLA；实际模型成本；旧 OPEN-DESIGN-Assistance 每个 legacy 文件的仍在引用情况；Adobe 各应用截至 2026-08-16 的具体 API/UXP 自动化覆盖矩阵。\n\n这些项目在迁移中都应采用同一个原则：\n\n```text\n未指定\n   ↓\nRepository / Runtime Evidence\n   ↓\nADR\n   ↓\nImplementation\n```\n\n而不是：\n\n```text\n未指定\n   ↓\nAgent 猜测\n   ↓\n直接改代码\n```\n\n这应成为 DESIGN-LAB V2 重构期间最重要的工程纪律之一。"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"finish_details":{"type":"stop","stop_tokens":[200002]},"is_complete":true,"citations":[],"content_references":[],"story_events":[],"resolved_model_slug":"gpt-5-thinking","cot_version":"v5","venus_message":true},"recipient":"all","channel":"final"}},"activity_messages":[{"id":"b9d88686-2326-4202-85b5-983ffbddb105","author":{"role":"tool","name":"GitHub.fetch","metadata":{}},"create_time":1786888623.007176,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":[]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_title":"Auditing Current GitHub Repository Tree","invoked_resource":{"resource_uri":"/connect